<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Q1 97 pre-tax profit 20 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Q1 97 pre-tax profit 20 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating LOSS		   1.0	 vs 49.0 (loss)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		  20.0	 vs(49.0)(loss)</p>
<p>    Group sales				 4,944    vs 4,557</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue			   4,438    vs 4,057</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>     -- passengers			    3,579    vs 3,281</p>
<p>     -- freight (including mail)	    859    vs   776</p>
<p>    Other revenue				 506    vs   500</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German airline group is Deutsch Lufthansa AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
